1
00:00:08,851 --> 00:00:11,886
Medoro poora Hindi mein bhi chalta hai.

2
00:00:11,926 --> 00:00:14,410
Upar EN aur Hindi ka switch hai.

3
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:16,223
Hindi par click kijiye.

4
00:00:16,976 --> 00:00:21,586
Ab sidebar, dashboard, button aur messages, sab
Hindi mein hain.

5
00:00:21,626 --> 00:00:26,453
Medicines ke naam aur bill par zaroori jaankari
waisi hi rehti hai.

6
00:00:27,216 --> 00:00:29,817
Billing screen bhi Hindi mein dekhiye.

7
00:00:29,857 --> 00:00:35,932
Har user apni bhaasha alag chun sakta hai; yeh
pasand usi ke account par yaad rehti hai.

8
00:00:36,693 --> 00:00:42,889
Ask screen par Hindi ya Hinglish mein sawaal
poochhiye, jaise: Aaj ki total sale kitni hai?

9
00:00:45,188 --> 00:00:48,137
Waapas English ke liye EN par click kijiye.

10
00:00:48,177 --> 00:00:52,238
Sign-up ke samay bhi interface language chuni ja
sakti hai.
